          "data": {
            "text": "## No radio needed\n\n**Signal generator** stands in for a radio: it makes a synthetic signal, so the canvas works with no hardware plugged in.\n\n**Scope** draws the spectrum it produces.\n\n**Channel** tunes and demodulates one signal out of that spectrum.\n\n**Baseband scope** shows the channel's constellation and eye, which is how you tell a locked decoder from a guessing one.\n\n**Speaker** plays the channel's audio.\n\nChange the generator's settings and watch both scopes follow."
